<title>UK: Goodhead buys Rexam's printing unit.</title>
<headline>Goodhead buys Rexam's printing unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goodhead Group Plc said on Friday that it has exchanged contracts for the purchase of Benham and Company, the printing subsidiary of Rexam Plc, for 2.25 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the funding for the consideration will be met by a medium term loan.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
